<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (Placewell International is a Filipino-owned, family-run DMW accredited manpower agency with over 50 years of experience in deploying Filipino workers overseas. Headquartered in Makati and supported by more than 15 branches and 5 training centers nationwide, we recruit, train, and deploy Filipino workers to companies all over the world. Placewell International is an ISO certified company that takes pride in providing our clients with high quality service in the form of prompt and active communication and massive and organized recruitment. Last but not least, our company has stood the test of time precisely because of the compassion that we have for the Filipino workers that we help. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [24]
>>
